-- L2 回放链 ams8000-equi-rotate-chain：EQUI /1-LNR-Q005-PJ (=24384/24776, dbnum 8000) 绕自身原点、绕 U 轴转 +90°——只动方位，POS 不变（刚体路的转动那一半）。
-- 基线方位 Y is N 5 W and Z is D（2026-10-24 TTY 实测）；本腿写整份终态 Y is W 5 S and Z is D，不写反向增量。
-- 子 BOX =24384/24777 转前转后各取一次世界位姿：它跟着根转，回执的 geometry_diff.moved 数的就是它。
-- 恰好一个 SAVEWORK；wrapper QUIT。SAVEWORK 之后拷一份库文件（真快照 → 字节补丁，见 equi_apply.mac）。
ONERROR CONTINUE
ALPHA LOG "D:/work/plant-code/old/gen-model/output/replay-record/equi_rotate_apply.log" OVER
$P REPLAY-ROTATE-APPLY-ALIVE
=24384/24777
Q REF
Q POS
Q POS WRT /*
Q ORI WRT /*
Q XLEN
Q YLEN
Q ZLEN
=24384/24776
Q NAME
Q REF
Q POS
Q ORI
ORI Y IS W 5 S AND Z IS D
Q POS
Q ORI
=24384/24777
Q POS WRT /*
Q ORI WRT /*
SAVEWORK 'replay chain ams8000-equi-rotate-chain: EQUI =24384/24776 rotate +90 about U through its own origin'
$P REPLAY-ROTATE-APPLY-SAVED
SYSCOM 'cmd /c copy /Y "E:\reverse\e3d\replay-src\E3D3.1\AvevaMarineSample\ams000\ams8000_0001" "D:\work\plant-code\old\gen-model\output\replay-record\snapshots-rotate\ams8000_0001.after-apply-save"'
$P REPLAY-ROTATE-APPLY-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
